Just tossing some ideas.

I guess the best way to decide is to put things in perspective: Collect a
bunch of similar useful concepts and see how we can assign different lujvo
to each one in a coherent way. I don't care if the exact meaning of a lujvo
is not obvious from its constituents.

By the way, don't forget to consider tremolos and vibratos, which are
periodic modulations of amplitude and frequency of a wave. They are the
oscillations children can perceive in sound.

mu'o
mi'e .asiz.




